Package: plotExcel
Type: Package
Title: Export pdf or png Files Into Excel
Version: 0.2.3
Authors@R: 
    person("Daniel", "Lill", , "dlill.unifreiburg@gmail.com", role = c("cre"))
Maintainer: 
    Daniel Lill <dlill.unifreiburg@gmail.com>
Description: Arrange plots from pdf or png files into an Excel file. 
    Allows for getting specific versions of the plots from git, extracting pages
    from a multipage pdf and cropping with a simple markup syntax.
    Text cells can be formatted using pre-specified styles using a simple markup
    syntax.
    To learn more, start with the example for `plotExcel()`.
License: AGPL (>= 3)
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
